### 8. Conclusion
Four supervised classifiers were tuned and evaluated. The model with the best cross-validation ROC-AUC was selected as the champion. The preprocessing steps were encapsulated in pipelines to prevent data leakage. The saved model can be loaded with joblib and used with the same feature columns as the training dataset.

**Disclaimer:** This is an educational classification project and must not be used for medical diagnosis.
